{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11115043","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11115043","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1111504301:0":{"text":"드디어 왔구나... 어서 나를 찾으러 오너라...! 내 가장 깊은 곳에서 너희를 기다릴 테니.","source_cn":"你们终于来了……来吧……快来寻找我！我在最深处等着你们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09B1E367AAB1849F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1111504302:0":{"text":"가장 깊은 곳에서 기다린다고? 와! 그럼 석양의 신을 만날 수 있는 건가?","source_cn":"在最深处等待？哇！我们是不是会见到残阳神？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x836E5DAD4B067CDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1111504303:0":{"text":"석양의 신은 이미 존재하지 않아. 그렇지 않다면 이 무덤이 어디서 왔겠어? 신이 말하고 있는 건 아닐 거야.","source_cn":"残阳神已经陨落了，否则哪来的这座墓穴？肯定不是祂在说话。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB44B234EBFCB265","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:神秘的呼唤":{"text":"신비로운 부름","source":"神秘的呼唤","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卡卡":{"text":"카이","source":"卡卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:萨忒娜":{"text":"사트라나","source":"萨忒娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":3}}